\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces User interface and workflow of the LigPlot3D web application. The clean and minimal interface of LigPlot3D is organized into four functional regions to streamline protein--ligand interaction analysis. (a) Control center: The left-hand panel provides target selection and visualization controls. (b) Structure input module: Users can upload a local PDB file or directly enter a PDB identifier. (c) Main visualization canvas: The central 3D rendering window displays the protein--ligand complex. (d) Analysis pane: A structured interaction table summarizes detected contacts.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:initial}{{1}{4}{User interface and workflow of the LigPlot3D web application. The clean and minimal interface of LigPlot3D is organized into four functional regions to streamline protein--ligand interaction analysis. (a) Control center: The left-hand panel provides target selection and visualization controls. (b) Structure input module: Users can upload a local PDB file or directly enter a PDB identifier. (c) Main visualization canvas: The central 3D rendering window displays the protein--ligand complex. (d) Analysis pane: A structured interaction table summarizes detected contacts}{figure.1}{}}
